---
import Layouts from "../layouts/layouts.astro";
import Contact from "../components/Contact.astro";
---

<Layouts
  title="About | Mubashir Dawood"
  description="Computer Science graduate and full-stack developer based in Cape Town, South Africa, specializing in Go, Python, and data-driven backend systems."
>
  <h1 class="section-title">About Me</h1>

  <div class="profile-card game-card">
    <div class="card-header">
      <small>Class: Software Engineer</small>
      <h2>Mubashir</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="profile-grid">
      <div class="avatar">
        <span>🕹️</span>
        <b>LVL 4</b>
      </div>

      <div class="perks">
        <div>
          <span class="perk-bullet" style="--clr: #4ade80">⚡</span> +50% Async Performance
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="perk-bullet" style="--clr: #fbbf24">🥊</span> Muay Thai Stance
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="perk-bullet" style="--clr: #f87171">🚗</span> Track Tuned Iteration
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Attributes -->
    <div class="attributes">
      <h3>Attributes</h3>

      <div class="stat">
        <label>Backend / Systems <span>80/100</span></label>
        <div class="bar">
          <div class="fill" style="--clr: var(--primary-color); --val: 80%">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stat">
        <label>Frontend / UI <span>60/100</span></label>
        <div class="bar">
          <div class="fill" style="--clr: #10b981; --val: 60%"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stat">
        <label>Data & Analytics <span>70/100</span></label>
        <div class="bar">
          <div class="fill" style="--clr: #a855f7; --val: 70%"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Inventory -->
    <div class="inventory">
      <h3>Equipped Inventory</h3>
      <div class="tags">
        <span class="skill-tag">Python</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">SvelteKit</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Astro</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">SQLite</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Go</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">HuggingFace</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">Groq</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="about">
    <div class="about-card">
      <p>
        I'm a Computer Science graduate who finds beauty in the "under the hood"
        mechanics of software. Whether I'm architecting a Go backend, optimizing
        a data pipeline, or fine-tuning an API, I'm driven by a need for
        performance and correctness.
      </p><br />
      <p>
        My approach to engineering is influenced by my life outside of the IDE.
        As a martial arts and fitness enthusiast, I believe in the power of
        incremental improvement and technical discipline, principles that
        translate directly to writing clean, maintainable code. When I'm not
        debugging systems or training, you'll likely find me absorbed in a
        strategy game or lost in a book.
      </p><br />
      <p>
        I'm on the hunt for a graduate or junior role that has an
        engineering-focused team where I can dig deep into backend services,
        systems programming, or data-driven application development.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Contact />
</Layouts>
